{"id":"n75048-1-8","stage":4,"title":"장기 · 特长","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75048-1-8-1","ko":"지수야, 너는 장기가 뭐니?","zh":"智秀，你的特长是什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"장기가","meaning":"特长","explanation":"장기：特长；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"장기","audio":"/audio/994fc13bf34735a1ab00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75048","senseId":"1","lemma":"장기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐니?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"994fc13bf34735a1","term":"장기","zh":"特长","audio":"/audio/994fc13bf34735a1ab00.mp3","entryId":"75048","definition":"特别擅长的才能。","pronunciation":["장끼"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/d9c2d5badd9b1e01bd9a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75048-1-8-2","ko":"저는 사람들 앞에서 노래하고 춤추는 것을 잘해요.","zh":"我擅长在大家面前唱歌跳舞。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람들","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞에서","meaning":"前面","explanation":"앞：前面；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"7","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"노래하고","meaning":"唱歌，歌唱","explanation":"노래하다：唱歌，歌唱；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"노래하다","audio":"/audio/d2505914aeb404881fec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64513","senseId":"1","lemma":"노래하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"춤추는","meaning":"跳舞","explanation":"춤추다：跳舞；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"춤추다","audio":"/audio/1fb31f8ce43529233719.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72145","senseId":"1","lemma":"춤추다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것을","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘해요.","meaning":"善于，擅长","explanation":"잘하다：善于，擅长；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"3","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"指某种环境或所处的状态。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"d2505914aeb40488","term":"노래하다","zh":"唱歌，歌唱","audio":"/audio/d2505914aeb404881fec.mp3","entryId":"64513","definition":"放声唱出谱好曲的具有韵律的歌词。","pronunciation":["노래하다"]},{"id":"1fb31f8ce4352923","term":"춤추다","zh":"跳舞","audio":"/audio/1fb31f8ce43529233719.mp3","entryId":"72145","definition":"伴着音乐或有节奏的拍子晃动身体。","pronunciation":["춤추다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"善于，擅长","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"熟练且手艺好。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f78378f269964c44fb0d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.036,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75048","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":138,"sequenceScore":2.6894,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我擅长在大家面前唱歌跳舞。","智秀，你的特长是什么？","车停在哪里了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["智秀，你的特长是什么？","车停在哪里了？","我擅长在大家面前唱歌跳舞。"],"answer":2}]}
